# Codex compatibility — AGENTS.md is codex's variant of CLAUDE.md (auto-created when
# codex runs in a repo without it). CLAUDE.md is the canonical agent doc for this repo;
# we don't maintain a parallel AGENTS.md. Codex can read CLAUDE.md fine, and may re-create
# AGENTS.md locally on its next run — gitignore prevents that copy from polluting the repo.
AGENTS.md
.maw/
